|               |                             HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(s_suppkey@0, l_suppkey@1), (s_nationkey@1, c_nationkey@0)], projection=[l_extendedprice@4, l_discount@5, s_nationkey@1]                              |
|               |                               CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                                 SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                                   CayenneAccelerationExec: snapshots_scanned=<N>, files_scanned=<N>                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                                     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                                       DataSourceExec: file_groups={2 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey], file_type=vortex, predicate: DynamicFilter [ empty ]                                                                                     |
|               |                               HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(o_orderkey@0, l_orderkey@0)], projection=[c_nationkey@1, l_suppkey@3, l_extendedprice@4, l_discount@5]                                             |
