|               |                                   HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(c_custkey@0, o_custkey@1)], projection=[o_orderkey@2, c_nationkey@1]                                                                           |
